          "Your personal reasons for wanting to lose weight are your motivation. Whenever you falter or encounter obstacles during your weight-loss journey, remind yourself why you're doing it. This will help you get through the tough times and keep going.\nWrite down three personal reasons. My three reasons to lose weight are ..."
